{"id": 13953, "group": "campus-nit-warangal-placements", "sent_at": "2026-10-27T05:02:02.140395+00:00", "text": "Round 1:\nIt was OA assessment consists of two coding questions(2 medium level on leetcode ) + OS(medium level )+COA(hard level) and C++ output questions (easy - medium )\nYou need a minimum of 60% to qualify next round.\n\nRound 2:\n\nRoles and responsibilities in the current organization.\nwhich OS will be used for Autonomous vehicles and why?\nThree easy - medium leetcode questions.\n\nRound 3 : (Technical)\n\n current role in the company. \nHow stack works in recursion \nImplement in-order traversal using stack and optimize it and explain time and space complexity.\nWrite a C program for handling 32-bit multiplication on a microprocessor ALU supporting 16-bit multiplication", "author_tag": "MNNI", "reply_to": {"id": 13611, "text": "Hello guys Did nvidia come for the system software engineer role", "author_tag": "NITR"}, "attachment": null, "deleted": false}
